        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Boston College, Stanford University\n- Places: Chestnut Hill, Massachusetts, Boston, Stanford, California, Palo Alto, San Jose, San Francisco, United States\n- Concepts: private research universities, Jesuit Catholic universities\n\nFacts:\n- Boston College is a private Jesuit Catholic research university in Chestnut Hill, Massachusetts, United States, 6 miles west of downtown Boston.\n- Boston College is also referred to as BC.\n- Stanford University is officially named Leland Stanford Junior University and is colloquially called the Farm.\n- Stanford University is a private research university in Stanford, California, adjacent to Palo Alto and between San Jose and San Francisco.",
